48
00:12:32,210 --> 00:12:33,210
Fifty grand.

49
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:37,920
Okay

50
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,080
I'll pay you.

51
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,120
Let's talk outside.

52
00:12:41,420 --> 00:12:42,420
That easy.

53
