105
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:27,000
Sir...

106
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,040
Can we leave now.

107
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:30,460
Yes.

108
00:16:30,670 --> 00:16:31,670
Keep your phone on.

109
00:16:33,330 --> 00:16:34,920
Sister, are you hurt.

110
00:16:35,460 --> 00:16:36,460
I'm fine.

111
00:16:37,290 --> 00:16:38,290
But.

112
00:16:38,620 --> 00:16:40,290
