There's a little beggar behind us.

122
00:17:00,380 --> 00:17:01,380
Wait here for a moment

123
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:02,540
I'll go give him some change.

124
00:17:03,290 --> 00:17:04,290
Wait here for me.

125
00:17:09,290 --> 00:17:10,290
Bold move.

126
00:17:10,540 --> 00:17:11,920
Let's talk over there.

127
00:17:21,079 --> 00:17:22,500
Nice spot you picked.

128
00:17:24,210 --> 00:17:25,710
I picked it just for you.

129
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,880
Tell my brothers what you have to say.

130
00:17:44,670 --> 00:17:45,670
Sister.

131
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:48,290
I'm here.

132
00:17:53,750 --> 00:17:55,120
I have change too.

133
00:17:56,670 --> 00:17:57,710
He's already gone.

134
00:18:00,460 --> 00:18:01,790
Let's go home.

135
00:18:03,670 --> 00:18:04,670
Mingzhu.

136
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:07,290
Go to Aunt Chen's and buy me some guangbing

137
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:08,960
I have to clean the equipment tonight.

138
00:18:09,420 --> 00:18:11,460
You finally let me go out alone

139
00:18:11,580 --> 00:18:12,580
I'm leaving then.

140
00:18:12,790 --> 00:18:13,790
Be careful.

141
00:18:13,880 --> 00:18:14,880
Okay.

142
00:18:27,250 --> 00:18:28,970
I suspect this isn't a simple disappearance.

143
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:31,250
Poison Rat knows too much.

144
00:18:31,620 --> 00:18:32,620
This case

145
00:18:32,710 --> 00:18:34,790
could be a breakthrough.

146
00:18:34,830 --> 00:18:36,470
To crack the cross-border crime syndicate.

147
00:18:40,670 --> 00:18:42,230
We're not the only ones looking for him.

148
00:18:42,330 --> 00:18:44,080
Several other forces have their eyes on him.

149
00:18:44,460 --> 00:18:45,460
Insufficient evidence.

150
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:46,540
Clues are lost.

151
00:18:46,670 --> 00:18:48,470
Further investigation
is a waste of resources.

152
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:50,080
Close the case.

153
00:18:50,620 --> 00:18:51,620
Close it.

154
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:53,290
If we let this clue go

155
00:18:53,380 --> 00:18:54,670
we'll never get close again.

156
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,000
You're a cop.

157
00:18:56,500 --> 00:18:57,580
You must follow orders.

158
00:18:57,620 --> 00:18:59,120
If we don't investigate, who will.

159
00:19:03,790 --> 00:19:04,790
I don't want

160
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:06,320
you to end up like your father.

161
00:19:06,420 --> 00:19:07,580
He threw himself into cases

162
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:08,920
and lost his life.

163
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:11,500
You're still young.

164
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:19,360
I won't sign the closure report.

165
00:19:22,710 --> 00:19:24,620
By ten tomorrow morning

166
00:19:24,670 --> 00:19:26,170
I want the case files on my desk.

167
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:39,830
There have been multiple
homicides in the city recently.

168
00:19:40,830 --> 00:19:42,436
Police suspect a professional

169
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:43,856
