170
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,620
is behind these murders.

171
00:19:46,790 --> 00:19:49,290
The organization uses cruel methods.

172
00:19:49,670 --> 00:19:51,210
Leaving no survivors.

173
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:52,976
They're also suspected of.

174
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,580
Colluding with local criminal gangs

175
00:19:54,830 --> 00:19:57,250
to carry out targeted assassinations.

176
00:20:07,040 --> 00:20:08,040
Hello.

177
00:20:08,380 --> 00:20:10,186
Check the surveillance near
the coffee shop again for me.

178
00:20:10,210 --> 00:20:11,380
Any leads on Poison Rat.

179
00:20:56,790 --> 00:20:58,040
Beautiful, kind

180
00:20:58,170 --> 00:21:00,250
lovely and excellent Ms. Minghui.

181
00:21:00,620 --> 00:21:03,330
Your delivery has arrived safely.

182
00:21:04,170 --> 00:21:05,170
You're back.

183
00:21:07,540 --> 00:21:08,710
Let's have dinner first.

184
00:21:13,710 --> 00:21:15,040
It smells good.

185
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:17,210
If you don't come eat

186
00:21:17,290 --> 00:21:20,210
your guangbing will be in Mingzhu's belly.

187
00:21:22,710 --> 00:21:24,350
I'm still cleaning the equipment, Mingzhu

188
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:25,920
I'll bring it down to you.

189
00:21:26,330 --> 00:21:27,040
Don't come down.

190
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,120
The floor is slippery.

191
00:21:31,790 --> 00:21:32,380
It's okay

192
00:21:32,660 --> 00:21:33,710
I'll wait here for you.

193
00:21:37,460 --> 00:21:38,460
Sister.

194
00:21:38,830 --> 00:21:39,830
Do you remember.

195
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:42,250
When we were at the orphanage

196
00:21:42,580 --> 00:21:43,830
I was always hungry.

197
00:21:44,500 --> 00:21:46,170
Every time my stomach growled

198
00:21:46,710 --> 00:21:48,790
you'd always magically get me guangbing.

199
00:21:50,670 --> 00:21:52,080
Back then, I really thought

200
00:21:53,210 --> 00:21:53,960
guangbing

201
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:56,170
was the most delicious thing in the world.

202
00:21:59,120 --> 00:22:00,540
Mingzhu, here's your guangbing.

203
00:22:05,620 --> 00:22:07,670
Eat slowly, don't choke.

204
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:08,580
Sister.

205
00:22:08,710 --> 00:22:09,710
You eat too.

206
00:22:10,380 --> 00:22:11,670
I'm full.

207
00:22:15,040 --> 00:22:16,040
You eat.

208
00:22:16,710 --> 00:22:18,250
Later I found out.

209
00:22:18,750 --> 00:22:19,750
Those flatbreads

210
00:22:20,120 --> 00:22:22,330
who got these back
every time you got beaten.

211
00:22:23,790 --> 00:22:24,250
Sister.

212
00:22:24,580 --> 00:22:25,580
Are you listening.

213
00:22:26,330 --> 00:22:27,330
I'm listening.

214
00:22:30,210 --> 00:22:31,290
After you left

215
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:33,330
my birthday wish every year

216
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:35,040
was for you to come back.

217
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:36,920
Today

218
00:22:37,080 --> 00:22:39,120
is the third anniversary of our reunion.

219
00:22:40,790 --> 00:22:41,380
Sister.

220
00:22:41,750 --> 00:22:43,080
We'll never be apart again.

221
00:22:43,540 --> 00:22:44,540
Right.

222
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:48,920
Yes.

223
00:22:49,380 --> 00:22:50,380
Never again.

224
00:22:54,170 --> 00:22:54,830
Sister.

225
00:22:55,120 --> 00:22:56,120
All these years

226
00:22:56,170 --> 00:22:57,500
were you alone too.

227
00:22:58,710 --> 00:23:00,080
Someone adopted me

228
00:23:00,380 --> 00:23:01,580
and some other kids.

229
00:23:02,420 --> 00:23:03,580
We called him Old Man.

230
00:23:09,040 --> 00:23:10,120
Stay in formation.

231
00:23:11,750 --> 00:23:13,250
Hang onto the rope.

232
00:23:19,080 --> 00:23:20,250
Check your weapons.

233
00:23:20,460 --> 00:23:21,580
Then push forward with force.

234
00:23:25,670 --> 00:23:26,670
Ladies.

235
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,120
Stay low in the water, goddammit.

236
00:23:29,620 --> 00:23:30,790
Keep your heads down.

237
00:23:33,170 --> 00:23:33,880
Good, good.

238
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,000
Pull harder.

239
00:23:35,210 --> 00:23:38,250
Close combat, yes, good.

240
00:23:38,380 --> 00:23:39,670
Excellent.

241
00:23:56,290 --> 00:23:58,396
Our goal is to become.

242
00:23:58,420 --> 00:24:00,040
The deadliest weapons in the world.

243
00:24:00,790 --> 00:24:02,670
The most elite and capable.

244
00:24:03,210 --> 00:24:05,146
This is the only way

245
00:24:05,170 --> 00:24:06,790
we survive in this damn world.

246
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:07,960
Understand.

247
00:24:08,040 --> 00:24:09,290
Yes, Old Man.

248
00:24:09,460 --> 00:24:10,460
What are we.

249
00:24:11,040 --> 00:24:11,920
Family.

250
00:24:12,040 --> 00:24:13,880
What must you always remember.

251
00:24:14,460 --> 00:24:15,670
Never part.

252
00:24:25,670 --> 00:24:27,670
Don't go soft just
because she's your sister.

253
00:24:42,040 --> 00:24:43,580
This is your killer instinct

254
00:25:20,580 --> 00:25:21,580
children.

255
00:25:22,330 --> 00:25:22,920
Today.

256
00:25:23,080 --> 00:25:25,330
It is to help you learn.

257
00:25:25,540 --> 00:25:28,330
In no circumstances
can we relax our vigilance.

258
00:25:29,620 --> 00:25:32,056
I want to see you all.

259
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:33,790
How to Turn the Tables in Adversity.

260
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,920
Go back.

261
00:25:35,710 --> 00:25:36,710
Hold her down.

262
00:25:50,420 --> 00:25:51,420
Tide.

263
00:25:52,080 --> 00:25:53,080
You are excellent.

264
00:25:53,540 --> 00:25:55,790
But you need to learn to
solve problems on your own.

265
00:25:55,960 --> 00:25:57,080
You are now protecting her.

266
00:25:58,750 --> 00:26:00,500
It's also destroying oneself.

267
00:26:01,460 --> 00:26:02,460
Lock her up.

268
00:26:41,250 --> 00:26:42,250
Eat quickly.

269
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:53,000
Slow down.

270
00:26:59,290 --> 00:27:00,290
Thank you.

271
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:07,640
Have you ever thought about leaving here.

272
00:27:11,620 --> 00:27:12,620
Yes.

273
00:27:16,120 --> 00:27:17,290
But I have to survive first.

274
00:27:19,540 --> 00:27:21,250
Where will you go when you leave.

275
00:27:24,620 --> 00:27:25,620
Find my sister.

276
00:27:26,380 --> 00:27:27,420
She's blind.

277
00:27:28,210 --> 00:27:29,250
I'm very worried about her.

278
00:27:31,420 --> 00:27:32,420
What about you.

279
00:27:37,120 --> 00:27:38,120
Me

280
00:27:38,170 --> 00:27:39,170
I don't know.

281
00:27:41,330 --> 00:27:42,330
Where's your family.

282
00:27:51,750 --> 00:27:52,750
Then from now on

283
00:27:54,330 --> 00:27:55,500
I'll be your sister.

284
00:29:45,620 --> 00:29:46,710
We grew up together.

285
00:29:47,040 --> 00:29:48,330
No one was ever left behind.

286
00:29:49,170 --> 00:29:50,460
After you came back

287
00:29:50,540 --> 00:29:51,980
do you still keep in touch with them.

288
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:54,920
No.

289
00:29:55,330 --> 00:29:57,420
We went our separate ways after we grew up.

290
00:29:59,120 --> 00:30:00,670
If he saw how happy I am

291
00:30:01,620 --> 00:30:02,670
he'd be happy for me.

292
00:30:05,420 --> 00:30:06,000
Sister.

293
00:30:06,420 --> 00:30:07,420
All these years

294
00:30:07,580 --> 00:30:08,900
have you been through a lot alone.

295
00:30:11,540 --> 00:30:13,000
As long as you're by my side

296
00:30:13,710 --> 00:30:14,710
everything is worth it.

297
