01:01:44,040 --> 01:01:44,710
Old Man.

603
01:01:45,040 --> 01:01:46,380
What do I have to do

604
01:01:48,120 --> 01:01:49,620
for you to let Tide go.

605
01:01:50,750 --> 01:01:51,920
I'm begging you.

606
01:01:52,540 --> 01:01:54,540
Please, please.

607
01:01:54,620 --> 01:01:55,750
You talk too much.

608
01:02:03,210 --> 01:02:04,750
